 and collaboration: no raiding or stealing – just a warm, supportive community to be part of.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/cd1f21044e9587e19c2d00604e314405.avif?t=1777635201\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras_big/cd1f21044e9587e19c2d00604e314405.avif?t=1777635201 width=800 height=91 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from popping bubbles to enjoy festival-inspired mini-games. Try your hand at goldfish scooping, music/rhythm challenges, ball tosses, shuriken throwing, and more. Earn hearts and coins while having a blast!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/ca9bf0a729ff291c47ce9dbedd4e0fe0.avif?t=1777635201\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras_big/ca9bf0a729ff291c47ce9dbedd4e0fe0.avif?t=1777635201 width=800 height=91 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick from a variety of cat avatars and customize them with outfits and accessories. Grow closer to your feline friend by feeding them treats and unlocking adorable animations—like hugging, dancing, and playful interactions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/2341bf27237f901f3e8fef778fb44840.avif?t=1777635201\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras_big/2341bf27237f901f3e8fef778fb44840.avif?t=1777635201 width=800 height=91 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a relaxed, welcoming atmosphere with flexible relationship options and a gentle romance/happiness system. Kimono Cats celebrates acceptance, creativity, and positive social interaction.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras/388d90e962fa0c094c55c29832f8dbb8.avif?t=1777635201\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3065080/extras_big/388d90e962fa0c094c55c29832f8dbb8.avif?t=1777635201 width=800 height=91 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock new festival roads, mini-games, and cultural backdrops as you level up. Expect to find hidden events, cameo characters, and new decorative collectibles that keep the festival spirit alive!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>18 Levels</strong> to Explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>18 Mini-Games</strong> for Extra Fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>112 Types of Bubbles</strong> (From Weather Effects to Coin Boosts)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>227 Village Items</strong> to Decorate (81 Decorations, 31 Plants, 60 Houses, 15 Terrain Pieces, 18 Stores, 22 Outfits)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>26 Playable Cat Avatars</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 Types of Candy-Jar Gacha with 7 Unique Item Categories</strong> (Decorations, Plants, Houses, Terrain, Stores, Outfits, Cards)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Positive Social Features</strong> (Gift-Giving, Visiting Others’ Villages, Supportive Community)</p></li></ul>",
